  "description": "The usage a Codex CLI 0.160.1 exec --json stream reports on turn.completed is the thread's cumulative token usage as of that turn's completion (ThreadTokenUsage.total), not a per-turn measurement. Authored from the pinned emitter and protocol types, independently of the writer's mapper and the oracle's profile; the numbers are the live recording's own.",
